## 🧩 6. Advanced Add-ons (for v2)
- 🔹 **Offline Mode:** use ESLint or Prettier locally if no API key.  
- 🔹 **Explain Button:** “Explain this line” → AI gives reasoning.  
- 🔹 **Code Complexity Estimator:** uses AST to approximate Big-O.  
- 🔹 **GitHub PR Mode:** Auto-analyze diffs during PR review.  
- 🔹 **Custom Themes:** Light/Dark overlay for UX consistency.  

