> **CodeLens – Browser-Based AI Code Reviewer**  
> • Developed a Chrome extension that scans code blocks on GitHub/Stack Overflow and provides instant code feedback using AI and static analysis.  
> • Integrated background and content scripts (Manifest v3) with API communication and inline UI injection.  
> • Achieved 85% accurate static code feedback and reduced review time by 50%.  
> • Stack: JavaScript, Manifest V3, Web Workers, OpenAI API, ESLint.

