# How to run it (local)

1) Create a folder `codelens-extension/` and add all files above.  
2) Go to **chrome://extensions** (or Edge: **edge://extensions**).  
3) Enable **Developer mode** (top-right).  
4) Click **Load unpacked** → select the `codelens-extension` folder.  
5) Open any page with code (GitHub, StackOverflow, docs).  
6) You’ll see **💡 Insights** badges under code blocks. Click to open the sidebar.

> If you don’t set a Hugging Face token yet, set mode to **Offline** in the popup — it’ll still work with static checks.

