# What to measure (for your résumé)

- **Median analysis latency** (50-line snippet): ~0.8–2.0s (hybrid), ~10–20ms (offline).  
- **Cache hit rate** after revisiting pages.  
- **Accuracy** (manual sanity check vs your own review): aim 75–85% “useful” comments.  
- **Memory footprint**: < 40 MB typical.

